# Quick capture → AI title enrichment

- **Behavior**: Quick captures are saved with a placeholder title (`Thought` in `quickCaptureMemory`). The Bull worker `quick-capture-enrichment` must replace it with a **specific, creative** title derived from the entry (and reflection prompt context when `prompt_text` exists).
- **Prompt**: System instructions live in `src/workers/quick-capture/index.ts` (`ENRICHMENT_SYSTEM`). When changing title behavior, update that string—not ad hoc strings elsewhere.
- **Guardrails**: `resolveEnrichmentTitle` rejects generic labels (e.g. "Thought", "Quick capture") when the body has substantive text, and falls back to a trimmed excerpt so users never stay on a dead placeholder.
- **Do not** strip title enrichment for daily reflections or other prompt-linked captures; they include `prompt_text` in the user message for better naming.
